---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="About" description="Hanbeom's reflections on defining and solving problems that span technology and organizations." alternateKo={new URL("/about/", Astro.site)} alternateEn={new URL("/en/about/", Astro.site)}>
  <article class="post">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p><h1>Looking back on how problems were defined and solved.</h1></header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I write about technical and organizational problems I encounter as a staff engineer. I look back at what the real problem was, which constraints and options mattered, and how work spanning multiple teams and systems moved forward.</p>
      <p>This is not a collection of successful choices. I also record what turned out differently than expected and what I would change next time, so each reflection can help me approach the next problem better.</p>
      <p>Each post begins with rough notes from the workday. AI organizes the context and decisions into a daily retrospective, which is edited into a form suitable for publication and released every day at 1 p.m. Korea Standard Time.</p>
      <p>Workplace details are removed or generalized before publication. I do not include company or customer names, internal addresses, security architecture, contract details, or information that could identify an individual.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
